<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#biba" title="In Benchmark of stylistic variation in LLM-generated texts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
